Z||000013||My7Fieros||09-11-2001||12:52 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Tina:<BR><B>I'am impressed guys......really nice job.<P>So what's next....<P>Tina  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>Good question, but you can count on something being in the works!<BR>Leadfoot, as far as stitching, that was the first time I ever used a sewing machine lol. I stiched it inside out, then pulled it inside out like a sock. (did that make sense?)  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_dizzy.gif"> you know what I mean.<P><P>------------------<BR><FONT SIZE="3"><FONT COLOR="red"><B><I>My 7 Fieros</FONT></FONT></B></I>||||reg||1
