Z||000015||Leadfoot||09-11-2001||06:17 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by My7Fieros:<BR><B> [QUOTE]Originally posted by Tina:<BR>[b]I'am impressed guys......really nice job.<P>So what's next....<P>Tina   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>Good question, but you can count on something being in the works!<BR>Leadfoot, as far as stitching, that was the first time I ever used a sewing machine lol. I stiched it inside out, then pulled it inside out like a sock. (did that make sense?)   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_dizzy.gif">  you know what I mean.<P>[/B][/QUOTE]<P>I don't know about your sewing machine but the one I used had like elevendee billion stitch patterns.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_wtf.gif">  I finally broke down and bought another aftermarket boot from pep boys.  I still am trying to get my hands on some yellow vinyl that comes in a roll so I can do the e-brake lever boot.  Time to hit the boat shops.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>||||reg||1
